ed_at":"2025-07-03T17:27:12Z"},"body":"Fixes #93986.\r\nFixes #103314.\r\nFixes #90597.\r\n\r\nThis (hopefully) makes it so that typed `Array`/`Dictionary` now behave largely the same as untyped `Array`/`Dictionary` when instancing scenes that have such exported properties, where the collection (belonging to `SceneState`) is shallowly duplicated, thus preventing the same underlying reference from being shared between all instances of said scene, and (I guess more importantly) preventing the `SceneState` copy of the collection from being changed.\r\n\r\nEDIT: This now also fixes `resource_local_to_scene` for objects in collections, by calling `setup_resources_in_array` and `setup_resources_in_dictionary` on the duplicated collection rather than the `SceneState` one.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108216/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108216/timeline","performed_via_